  "content": "\n\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MCWAR/BH_MC_Title.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1903\" height=\"594\"></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fericplane.github.io%252fbhredirect%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MCWAR/BH_MC_BisectPromo.png\" width=\"3209\" height=\"535\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MCWAR/BH_MC_Overview.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"123\"></p>\n<p><strong>描述：</strong></p>\n<p>隆重推出令人驚豔的整合包，為您帶來身臨其境的戰爭體驗！內含豐富的機能，包括槍械、核武與炸彈等先進武器，以及堅固的防具與安全裝置，讓您徹底感受真實士兵的氣息。</p>\n<p>此外，本整合包內建語音聊天系統，方便團隊間無縫溝通，是伺服器運作的完美選擇。準備好展開一場前所未有的冒險吧，在刺激的戰爭環境中，體驗核彈空投等驚險萬分的隨機事件。</p>\n<p>探索遼闊的地圖時，您將發現數百座寶藏建築，內部堆滿了可用於戰術優勢的機械與裝備。無論您偏好潛行作戰還是正面強攻，一切由您決定。遊戲提供豐富的搜刮選項，包括建築、村莊、核武設施等，應有盡有。</p>\n<p>我們持續更新此整合包，未來還有許多令人期待的計畫。若您遇到任何錯誤或對未來版本有任何建議，歡迎隨時告知。我們致力於為您提供最完美的遊玩體驗。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>重要資訊：</strong></p>\n<p>請務必確保現代戰爭模組的「換彈」鍵設為 R 鍵，且不要有其他按鍵與 R 鍵衝突，否則將無法換彈！！！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MCWAR/BH_MC_Community.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"123\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252ffbmjhRKzqe\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://discord.com/api/guilds/977571205328543776/widget.png?style=banner2\" alt=\"Discord Banner 2\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>已安裝模組：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/default-options\" rel=\"nofollow\">Default Options (by BlayTheNinth)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mixin-booter\" rel=\"nofollow\">MixinBooter (by CleanroomMC)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/omlib\" rel=\"nofollow\">OMLib (by Keridos)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/torch-lever\" rel=\"nofollow\">Torch Lever (by cleverpanda714)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cyclic\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cyclic (by Lothrazar)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-discord-rpc\" rel=\"nofollow\">Simple Discord RPC (by hypherionsa)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/future-mc\" rel=\"nofollow\">Future MC (by thedarkcolour)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/buildcraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">Buildcraft (by Covert_Jaguar)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/smart-hud\" rel=\"nofollow\">Smart HUD (by HeckinChloe)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-advancements\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Advancements (by way2muchnoise)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/autoreglib\" rel=\"nofollow\">AutoRegLib (by Vazkii)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/red-core\" rel=\"nofollow\">Red Core (by Desoroxxx)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chameleon\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chameleon (by Texelsaur)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/resource-loader\" rel=\"nofollow\">Resource Loader (by Lumien231)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cha-s\" rel=\"nofollow\">Craftable Horse Armour &amp; Saddle [CHA&amp;S] (by EwyBoy)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-engineering\" rel=\"nofollow\">Immersive Engineering (by BluSunrize)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-placement\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Placement (by tterrag1098)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-main-menu\" rel=\"nofollow\">Custom Main Menu (by Lumien231)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/swingthroughgrass\" rel=\"nofollow\">SwingThroughGrass (by exidex)</a></li>\n<li