-mods/corpse\" rel=\"nofollow\">Corpse (by henkelmax)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spartan-weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spartan Weaponry (by ObliviousSpartan)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/comforts\" rel=\"nofollow\">Comforts (Fabric/Forge/Quilt) (by TheIllusiveC4)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchanting-plus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enchanting Plus (by DarkhaxDev)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/supermartijn642s-core-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\">SuperMartijn642's Core Lib (by SuperMartijn642)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/malisiscore\" rel=\"nofollow\">MalisisCore (by Ordinastie)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/appleskin\" rel=\"nofollow\">AppleSkin (by squeek502)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-resources-jer\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Resources (JER) (by way2muchnoise)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/inventory-tweaks\" rel=\"nofollow\">Inventory Tweaks [1.12 only] (by JimeoWan)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/creativecore\" rel=\"nofollow\">CreativeCore (by CreativeMD)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/veinminer\" rel=\"nofollow\">VeinMiner (by Portablejim)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/supermartijn642s-config-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\">SuperMartijn642's Config Lib (by SuperMartijn642)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quark\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quark (by Vazkii)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moving-elevators\" rel=\"nofollow\">Moving Elevators (by SuperMartijn642)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mantle\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mantle (by mDiyo)</a></li>\