acts-forgelin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Shadowfacts' Forgelin (by ShadowfactsDev)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ambientsounds\" rel=\"nofollow\">AmbientSounds 6 (by CreativeMD)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/crafttweaker\" rel=\"nofollow\">CraftTweaker (by Jaredlll08)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minetweaker-recipemaker\" rel=\"nofollow\">MineTweaker RecipeMaker (by DoubleDoorDev)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/flux-networks\" rel=\"nofollow\">Flux Networks (by sonar_sonic)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/codechicken-lib-1-8\" rel=\"nofollow\">CodeChicken Lib 1.8.+ (by covers1624)</a></li>\n</ul>",
